            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I don't think there was any reasonably substantial reason here. Probably a combination of \"fit in as few lines as possible while exceeding maximum width of 78\" and \"showcase that `start()` is non-blocking but waits for return value which can be used later\".",
